  "summary": "Bind generic candidate authority-floor admission and its adversarial tests.",
  "why": "Candidate-local Git history proved scope and evidence but did not prove that a candidate began after its latest authorization, and unselected eligible candidates bypassed generic admission. This revision binds the minimal ledger-derived ancestry guard, copied-entry refusal, descendant-base support, structural bootstrap compatibility, and all-candidate integration admission."
